@title A refused terminal edit is a triangle chip with the reason in it, not a toast
@area Schematic
# T8: Set terminal level with no strip yet. The edit does not happen; a yellow triangle chip at the bottom right names it, click it for the reason. The next key press clears it.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "set terminal level"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Warning: No terminal strip yet"
shot refusal-chip
click_text "No terminal strip yet"
wait 5
expect "Place a terminal"
shot refusal-detail
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
key Escape
wait 5
expect_not "Warning: No terminal strip yet"
shot refusal-gone
